### Create a payment in PostgreSQL

POST http://localhost:8080/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "Pay-DB-001",
  "amount": 725.50,
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}

###

### Read all payments from PostgreSQL

GET http://localhost:8080/payments

###

### Read one payment from PostgreSQL

GET http://localhost:8080/payments/Pay-DB-001

### Get every payment.

GET http://localhost:8080/payments

###

### Get completed payments only.

GET http://localhost:8080/payments?status=COMPLETED

###

### Get pending payments only.

GET http://localhost:8080/payments?status=PENDING

###

### Get failed payments only.

GET http://localhost:8080/payments?status=FAILED